    <string name="google_how">How to get a key</string>
    <string name="google_how_body">1. Open console.cloud.google.com and create a project (billing must be on; Google gives a free monthly allowance).\n\n2. APIs &amp; Services → Library → enable: Map Tiles API, Routes API, Places API (New), Geocoding API.\n\n3. APIs &amp; Services → Credentials → Create credentials → API key.\n\n4. Recommended: restrict the key to Android apps with\nPackage: %1$s\nSHA-1: %2$s\n\n5. Copy the key and paste it in “API key” here, then tap “Test key”.\n\nIf a Google service fails, the app falls back to the free OpenStreetMap one.</string>
